  "goodToKnow": "Der Mittelwert is the mean or average in statistics: das arithmetische Mittel, den Mittelwert bilden or berechnen. In everyday speech, der Durchschnitt is more common. Der Median is the middle value, which is often used for incomes because a few very high earners distort the Mittelwert. Plural: die Mittelwerte."
